SS_VARIANT 56 [(4,), (6, 3, 15), (3,), (6, 3, 39)] (3,) 3 6 False (6, 0) [21, 27]\nCROSS_VARIANT 56 [(4,), (6, 3, 15), (3,), (6, 3, 39)] (3,) 4 6 False (6, 0) [21, 27]\nCROSS_VARIANT 56 [(4,), (6, 3, 15), (3,), (6, 3, 39)] (3,) 5 6 False (6, 0) [21, 27]\nCROSS_VARIANT 56 [(4,), (6, 3, 15), (3,), (6, 3, 39)] (3,) 6 6 False (6, 0) [21, 27]\nCROSS_VARIANT 56 [(4,), (6, 3, 15), (3,), (6, 3, 39)] (3,) 7 6 False (6, 0) [21, 27]\nCROSS_VARIANT 56 [(4,), (6, 3, 15), (3,), (6, 3, 39)] (3,) 8 6 False (6, 0) [21, 27]\nCROSS_VARIANT 48 [(4,), (6, 3, 15), (3,), (6, 3, 39)] (4,) 0 6 False (6, 3) []\nCROSS_VARIANT 49 [(4,), (6, 3, 15), (3,), (6, 3, 39)] (4,) 1 6 False (6, 4) []\nCROSS_VARIANT 51 [(4,), (6, 3, 15), (3,), (6, 3, 39)] (4,) 2 6 False (6, 5) []\nRESULT 6 196 None\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_30","type":"agent_message","text":"The near-route now reproduces a concrete 48–56-band climb and the final isolated side room, but no reward. The accounting is revealing: the preserved prefix has 54 actions, so prefix + four left moves + switch is 59 actions, while both earlier winning harness observations used 60 level-7 actions. I’m auditing the preserved “one missing action” scans to identify which insertion classes were actually covered before launching a complete but bounded replay."}}
