e) (0, None) (6, False, (45.3, 28.5), (21.0, 22.0), (0, 5, 11, 17, 23, 29, 35), '######../......../......v./.T.##.#./...##A../...#####/########/########/########/########')\nBOTTOM_TRY (6, 3, 11) (0, None) (0, None) (6, False, (45.3, 28.5), (21.0, 22.0), (0, 5, 11, 17, 23, 29, 35), '######../......../......v./.T.##.#./...##A../...#####/########/########/########/########')\nBOTTOM_TRY (6, 3, 17) (0, None) (0, None) (6, False, (45.3, 28.5), (21.0, 22.0), (0, 5, 11, 17, 23, 29, 35), '######../......../......v./.T.##.#./...##A../...#####/########/########/########/########')\nBOTTOM_TRY (6, 3, 23) (0, None) (0, None) (6, False, (45.3, 28.5), (21.0, 22.0), (0, 5, 11, 17, 23, 29, 35), '######../......../......v./.T.##.#./...##A../...#####/########/########/########/########')\nBOTTOM_TRY (6, 3, 29) (0, None) (0, None) (6, False, (45.3, 28.5), (21.0, 22.0), (0, 5, 11, 17, 23, 29, 35), '######../......../......v./.T.##.#./...##A../...#####/########/########/########/########')\nBOTTOM_TRY (6, 3, 35) (0, None) (0, None) (6, False, (45.3, 28.5), (21.0, 22.0), (0, 5, 11, 17, 23, 29, 35), '######../......../......v./.T.##.#./...##A../...#####/########/########/########/########')\nRESULT 6 196 None\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_76","type":"agent_message","text":"The opening trace exposes the key mechanic: 6 is a press/hold, while 7 releases the last pressed object. Pressing an inert void before releasing retargets the release, leaving the prior gravity/support effect latched. That sequence safely enters the target’s right-hand chamber. I’m enumerating which two physical strip controls preserve an unused gravity flip there, then I’ll verify the short “rise, cross left, fall onto target” plan."}}
